WEBVTT

1
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.585
In verse 11.32

2
00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:46.588
of the eleventh chapter, it is described.

3
00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:49.549
When Arjun asked Lord Krishna this question,

4
00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:53.053
who He is and what His purpose is,

5
00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:53.636
Lord Krishna,

6
00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:57.390
revealing a profound truth, says

7
00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.477
that 'I am Kala – time.

8
00:01:00.477 --> 00:01:02.812
The great destroyer

9
00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:04.397
of all worlds.'

10
00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:12.697
This is the great moment in the Bhagavad Gita,

11
00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:13.615
where Lord Krishna

12
00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:17.660
identifies Himself with time.

13
00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.955
That invincible force which carries every

14
00:01:20.955 --> 00:01:24.125
thing in the material world to its end.

15
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:27.629
He declares that except for the Pandavas,

16
00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:29.089
of all the warriors

17
00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:30.757
present on the battlefield,

18
00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.426
the destruction is already certain.

19
00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.177
Their fate,

20
00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:35.220
by time,

21
00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:38.014
has already been determined,

22
00:01:38.014 --> 00:01:41.476
and even if Arjun refuses to fight,

23
00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:42.227
even then

24
00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:45.730
they will be destroyed through
some other means.

25
00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.440
The message is clear,

26
00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.777
destruction in the material world is inevitable.

27
00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:54.614
Even the greatest warriors cannot escape time.

28
00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:55.824
But Lord Krishna

29
00:01:55.824 --> 00:01:58.618
gives Arjun a choice.

30
00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:03.164
'Fight and become My instrument,
or stand

31
00:02:03.164 --> 00:02:07.127
aside and let time do its work.'

32
00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:08.878
Lord Krishna's declaration

33
00:02:08.878 --> 00:02:11.589
shatters Arjun's hesitation.

34
00:02:11.589 --> 00:02:14.008
Until now, Arjun was struggling, with the

35
00:02:14.008 --> 00:02:15.385
morality of war.

36
00:02:15.385 --> 00:02:16.511
He was wondering

37
00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:18.763
whether he should fight.

38
00:02:18.763 --> 00:02:22.559
But now Lord Krishna tells him,

39
00:02:22.559 --> 00:02:25.436
'Your decision does not change the outcome.

40
00:02:25.436 --> 00:02:27.897
They are already like the dead.

41
00:02:27.897 --> 00:02:31.484
Time destroys all things, and I

42
00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.820
am that very time.'

43
00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.239
This is not a cruel display of power,

44
00:02:36.239 --> 00:02:38.741
but the reality of life.

45
00:02:38.741 --> 00:02:40.326
Seasons change,

46
00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:44.706
rivers dry up, and civilisations rise and fall.

47
00:02:44.706 --> 00:02:47.458
Time ensures that, in the material world,

48
00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:50.587
in this same way, nothing is permanent.

49
00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:54.007
In Lord Krishna's every single
word there is a deep teaching.

50
00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:56.593
If we become attached to those things

51
00:02:56.593 --> 00:02:59.429
that time will ultimately take away,

52
00:02:59.429 --> 00:03:02.140
wealth, power, relationships,

53
00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:05.226
or even our body,

54
00:03:05.226 --> 00:03:07.395
then sorrow is inevitable.

55
00:03:07.395 --> 00:03:11.274
In such a case, to find true
peace, one must understand

56
00:03:11.274 --> 00:03:15.612
that all material things are
temporary, and one must seek

57
00:03:15.612 --> 00:03:19.449
Lord Krishna's devotion, which is eternal.

58
00:03:19.449 --> 00:03:20.700
Lord Krishna's purpose

59
00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.368
in this description

60
00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:24.746
is to make Arjun understand that 

61
00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:27.874
he is not the cause, of the warriors death.

62
00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:29.375
Their karma and time

63
00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:32.545
have already determined their fate.

64
00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:35.423
Lord Krishna is only showing them the truth.

65
00:03:35.423 --> 00:03:37.842
Destruction is part of the material cycle,

66
00:03:37.842 --> 00:03:40.595
just as creation is.

67
00:03:40.595 --> 00:03:42.555
This verse is one of the Bhagavad Gita's

68
00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:45.350
most famous verses.

69
00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.517
It has been referenced

70
00:03:46.517 --> 00:03:50.063
by great thinkers and scientists too,

71
00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:53.900
because it reveals the invincible nature of time.

72
00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.360
Through this, Lord Krishna

73
00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.904
teaches a universal truth,

74
00:03:57.904 --> 00:04:00.657
that holding on to temporary things

75
00:04:00.657 --> 00:04:03.201
brings sorrow in a person's life,

76
00:04:03.201 --> 00:04:08.289
while understanding the eternal
nature of the soul makes one wise.

77
00:04:12.835 --> 00:04:16.965
Do you know what your greatest wealth is?

78
00:04:16.965 --> 00:04:19.217
Far more valuable than jewels, money, land, buildings,

79
00:04:19.217 --> 00:04:23.137
and so on?

80
00:04:23.137 --> 00:04:25.807
Let me tell you,

81
00:04:25.807 --> 00:04:28.601
that priceless wealth.

82
00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:29.811
Time.

83
00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:34.607
Time is the greatest gift I have given,

84
00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:37.110
and it

85
00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.320
is I Myself,

86
00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:44.117
just as I explain to Arjun in this verse.

87
00:04:44.117 --> 00:04:46.786
Time moves forward without stopping.

88
00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:50.498
It brings both opportunity and ending.

89
00:04:50.498 --> 00:04:51.874
Just as a student is given

90
00:04:51.874 --> 00:04:53.584
time to prepare for an exam,

91
00:04:53.584 --> 00:04:57.588
in the same way, in this life

92
00:04:57.588 --> 00:04:59.132
your time

93
00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:02.552
is for spiritual preparation.

94
00:05:02.552 --> 00:05:04.721
If you waste it in temporary pleasures

95
00:05:04.721 --> 00:05:07.932
or distractions,

96
00:05:07.932 --> 00:05:10.601
then on the spiritual path,

97
00:05:10.601 --> 00:05:14.147
the opportunity to grow further you lose.

98
00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:15.857
Every moment

99
00:05:15.857 --> 00:05:20.445
that you spend,, in meaningful work,
spiritual practice,

100
00:05:20.445 --> 00:05:24.657
and helping others,

101
00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:25.825
it brings you

102
00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:29.162
closer to your true purpose.

103
00:05:29.162 --> 00:05:31.414
But the time that is lost only

104
00:05:31.414 --> 00:05:33.583
in things that bind you

105
00:05:33.583 --> 00:05:35.543
to this world.

106
00:05:35.543 --> 00:05:40.298
Pointless entertainment, gossip,
or the race for material things,

107
00:05:40.298 --> 00:05:43.259
it leads you astray.

108
00:05:43.259 --> 00:05:47.180
Just as exam day comes,

109
00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:50.391
whether the student is ready or not,

110
00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:54.687
in the same way, your time
in this world is limited.

111
00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:57.857
Use it wisely.

112
00:05:57.857 --> 00:06:02.320
Focus on what truly matters

113
00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:07.867
and what takes you toward your spiritual goal.

114
00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:09.869
Pay attention to this.

115
00:06:14.374 --> 00:06:16.751
Have you ever thought

116
00:06:16.751 --> 00:06:20.713
about how fair it is to blame time

117
00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:24.425
for your failures and difficulties?

118
00:06:24.425 --> 00:06:25.635
In family life,

119
00:06:25.635 --> 00:06:29.931
you often hear people say,

120
00:06:29.931 --> 00:06:33.768
'This person's time is not going well,'

121
00:06:33.768 --> 00:06:34.894
as if time itself

122
00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:37.605
were responsible for their hardships.

123
00:06:37.605 --> 00:06:42.610
But understand this – time is Me.

124
00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.405
It is a form of Me,

125
00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:47.657
and like Me,

126
00:06:47.657 --> 00:06:50.118
it is impartial.

127
00:06:50.118 --> 00:06:54.831
Time does not bring misfortune or fortune.

128
00:06:54.831 --> 00:06:56.207
It simply

129
00:06:56.207 --> 00:07:00.503
brings the results of your past actions forward.

130
00:07:00.503 --> 00:07:04.841
Just as a seed, once sown,

131
00:07:04.841 --> 00:07:07.718
sprouts when the right season comes,

132
00:07:07.718 --> 00:07:11.389
in the same way, the results of your actions

133
00:07:11.389 --> 00:07:14.851
come forward when the time is right.

134
00:07:14.851 --> 00:07:16.936
If you sow seeds as kindness,

135
00:07:16.936 --> 00:07:20.523
honesty, and compassion ,

136
00:07:20.523 --> 00:07:24.402
then time will bring good results for you.

137
00:07:24.402 --> 00:07:26.946
But if you, selfishness,

138
00:07:26.946 --> 00:07:30.533
dishonesty, or harm sow as seeds,

139
00:07:30.533 --> 00:07:33.578
then time will bring challenges.

140
00:07:33.578 --> 00:07:36.914
One should not fear time,

141
00:07:36.914 --> 00:07:40.209
nor should one blame it.

142
00:07:40.209 --> 00:07:41.461
It is an

143
00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:45.381
impartial and just force

144
00:07:45.381 --> 00:07:47.175
that ensures

145
00:07:47.175 --> 00:07:48.426
that you

146
00:07:48.426 --> 00:07:51.929
receive results in keeping with your choices.

147
00:07:51.929 --> 00:07:53.848
Teach your family

148
00:07:53.848 --> 00:07:57.977
to see time as a teacher,

149
00:07:57.977 --> 00:08:00.938
not as a judge.

150
00:08:00.938 --> 00:08:02.607
Use every moment

151
00:08:02.607 --> 00:08:05.693
to do good deeds,

152
00:08:05.693 --> 00:08:10.448
knowing that the deeds done with time

153
00:08:10.448 --> 00:08:13.075
will return as blessings

154
00:08:13.075 --> 00:08:15.244
and peace.

155
00:08:19.665 --> 00:08:20.958
Think about this,

156
00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:25.963
when an obstacle arises,
in some professional project, 

157
00:08:25.963 --> 00:08:30.009
what does a true leader do?

158
00:08:30.009 --> 00:08:33.221
Do they, anxious about success,

159
00:08:33.221 --> 00:08:36.140
make half-hearted efforts?

160
00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:40.394
Do they give up and shut the project down,

161
00:08:40.394 --> 00:08:42.438
or, staying positive,

162
00:08:42.438 --> 00:08:46.609
make every possible effort to find a solution?

163
00:08:46.609 --> 00:08:49.820
In your professional life too, worry

164
00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:53.866
and stress usually come from
dwelling in the past

165
00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:58.120
or worrying about the future.

166
00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:00.456
But remember,

167
00:09:00.456 --> 00:09:02.083
time

168
00:09:02.083 --> 00:09:04.752
is a form of Me.

169
00:09:04.752 --> 00:09:08.381
Steady, impartial, and invincible.

170
00:09:08.381 --> 00:09:11.759
Just as Arjun saw that, on the battle-field,

171
00:09:11.759 --> 00:09:15.221
everything was already determined,

172
00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:17.139
in the same way, understand that

173
00:09:17.139 --> 00:09:20.351
the ups and downs of your professional life

174
00:09:20.351 --> 00:09:24.730
are part of a larger flow.

175
00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:28.276
Dwelling on past mistakes,

176
00:09:28.276 --> 00:09:32.071
or fearing future outcomes,

177
00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:33.864
only and only

178
00:09:33.864 --> 00:09:37.243
wastes your precious time.

179
00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:42.248
The present moment is where your power lies.

180
00:09:42.248 --> 00:09:47.295
Use it wisely.

181
00:09:47.295 --> 00:09:49.755
Instead of thinking too much

182
00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:53.342
about what might happen,

183
00:09:53.342 --> 00:09:57.013
what you can do today,

184
00:09:57.013 --> 00:09:58.848
focus on that.

185
00:09:58.848 --> 00:09:59.974
Success comes from continuous

186
00:09:59.974 --> 00:10:03.311
effort and hard work,

187
00:10:03.311 --> 00:10:05.771
not from pointless worry.

188
00:10:05.771 --> 00:10:09.650
When challenges come, remind yourself

189
00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:14.864
that nothing, nothing lasts forever.

190
00:10:14.864 --> 00:10:16.699
Neither failure

191
00:10:16.699 --> 00:10:19.368
nor success.

192
00:10:19.368 --> 00:10:22.163
By accepting the nature of time,

193
00:10:22.163 --> 00:10:25.333
you become calm in difficult times

194
00:10:25.333 --> 00:10:29.295
and stay alert when good times are running.

195
00:10:29.295 --> 00:10:30.546
This understanding,

196
00:10:30.546 --> 00:10:34.258
let it guide your work,

197
00:10:34.258 --> 00:10:35.968
which will help you to work,

198
00:10:35.968 --> 00:10:43.100
in your present, with focus,
confidence, and peace, ,

199
00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:45.811
whatever the future may bring.
